<section class="box"><h2>Then train</h2><p>Warmed up? Pick a <a href="/w/">workout plan</a> for your level, or <a href="/start/">start with the beginner guide</a> if you are new. Check your numbers against the <a href="/standards/">strength standards</a>.</p></section>
